WEBVTT

00:00:08.024 --> 00:00:09.567
BUCK (echoing):
Single file, everyone.
大家排成一排 向熔岩瀑布前进

00:00:09.651 --> 00:00:11.319
Head for Lava Falls.
大家排成一排 向熔岩瀑布前进

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:14.280
(creaking)

00:00:14.364 --> 00:00:15.782
(rumbling)

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:18.410
(Crash and Eddie gasp)

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.121
(creaking)

00:00:21.204 --> 00:00:24.749
(whispering)

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:26.209
What's that sound?
-那是什么声音？
-风在跟我们说话

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.544
It's the wind.
-那是什么声音？
-风在跟我们说话

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.129
It's speaking to us.
-那是什么声音？
-风在跟我们说话

00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:30.755
W-What's it saying?
-他说什么啦？
-不知道

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:31.840
I don't know.
-他说什么啦？
-不知道

00:00:31.923 --> 00:00:34.009
I don't speak Wind.
我不会说风话

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.427
Ooh.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.013
(groaning)

00:00:39.097 --> 00:00:42.517
(dinosaurs hissing)

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.727
Ellie?
-艾莉！
-我没事 别担心我

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.061
I'm fine.
-艾莉！
-我没事 别担心我

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.855
Don-Don't worry about me.
I'm just taking my t...
我只是在…

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:47.856
(screams)
我只是在…

00:00:47.939 --> 00:00:48.898
(hissing)

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.651
Ellie-- whoa!
艾莉！

00:00:51.735 --> 00:00:53.236
(shrieking)
艾莉！

00:00:54.279 --> 00:00:55.488
Manny!
-曼尼！
-跳到岩壁上！

00:00:55.572 --> 00:00:56.489
Get to the ledge.
-曼尼！
-跳到岩壁上！

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.199
(grunts)

00:00:58.283 --> 00:01:00.160
(screaming)

00:01:01.995 --> 00:01:04.080
(all screaming)

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:05.832
Whoa!

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.214
(grunts)

00:01:13.298 --> 00:01:14.424
Ellie!
艾莉！

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.053
CRASH:
Ellie, where are you?
艾莉！你在哪里？

00:01:18.136 --> 00:01:19.387
ELLIE:
It's okay.
没事！我在这上面

00:01:19.471 --> 00:01:20.889
I'm up here.
没事！我在这上面

00:01:20.972 --> 00:01:22.140
Hang on, Ellie!
艾莉 撑着点！我们马上过去！

00:01:22.223 --> 00:01:24.601
We'll be right there!
艾莉 撑着点！我们马上过去！

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.899
(groans)

00:01:30.982 --> 00:01:33.276
(all chittering and laughing)

00:01:38.406 --> 00:01:40.867
(dinosaur growls distantly)

00:01:42.243 --> 00:01:43.244
Whoa!

00:01:43.328 --> 00:01:46.081
(grunts)

00:01:46.164 --> 00:01:48.333
Wait! Sloth down!
等等！树獭倒下了！

00:01:50.335 --> 00:01:52.003
(panting):
Wait, wait, wait.
等等 暂停！

00:01:52.087 --> 00:01:53.630
Time out.
等等 暂停！

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:54.964
Hold up.
等等啊！你们跑得真快！

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:58.301
Sheesh, you guys are getting fast.
等等啊！你们跑得真快！

00:02:02.097 --> 00:02:04.057
Ah, it's not so bad down here.
这儿还不赖 天气好 邻里和睦

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:06.392
Nice weather, friendly neighbors.
这儿还不赖 天气好 邻里和睦

00:02:06.476 --> 00:02:08.478
(screaming)

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.896
(dinosaur exhales)

00:02:09.979 --> 00:02:12.315
(shuddering)

00:02:13.316 --> 00:02:14.859
Hi, neighbor.
嗨 好邻居

00:02:14.943 --> 00:02:16.152
(dinosaur roaring loudly)

00:02:17.987 --> 00:02:18.947
Rudy.
-鲁迪
-鲁迪？

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.658
-Rudy?
-(Sid screaming)
-鲁迪
-鲁迪？

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.743
Never heard that kind of dino before.
-从没听过这种恐龙叫
-那是希德！

00:02:23.827 --> 00:02:25.703
-That's Sid.
-We'll have to move fast.
-我们得赶快
-曼尼！菠萝！

00:02:25.787 --> 00:02:27.205
ELLIE:
Manny!
-我们得赶快
-曼尼！菠萝！

00:02:27.288 --> 00:02:28.665
Pineapples!
-我们得赶快
-曼尼！菠萝！

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:29.874
Pineapples?
-菠萝？
-她大概想吃了

00:02:29.958 --> 00:02:30.917
She gets cravings.
-菠萝？
-她大概想吃了

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.335
ELLIE:
Pomegranates?
石榴吗？葡萄柚！油桃？

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.419
Grapefruits.
石榴吗？葡萄柚！油桃？

00:02:33.503 --> 00:02:34.337
Nectarines?
石榴吗？葡萄柚！油桃？

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.256
She's ordering a fruit cocktail.
她想要水果拼盘

00:02:36.339 --> 00:02:38.758
Come on, think.
快点 想啊！

00:02:38.842 --> 00:02:40.051
Peaches!
桃子！

00:02:40.135 --> 00:02:41.136
(echoes)
桃子！

00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:42.846
Peaches?
桃子？

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:43.847
Peaches!
桃子！宝宝！什么 现在吗？

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.182
The baby! W-W-What now?!
桃子！宝宝！什么 现在吗？

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.809
-This... not good.
-No! Oh, no!
这可不大妙呀

00:02:47.892 --> 00:02:49.310
The baby's coming!
Did you guys hear that?!
宝宝要出生了！你们听到了吗？

00:02:49.394 --> 00:02:51.104
'Cause sometimes
I imagine it in my head.
我有时会幻听 但…

00:02:51.187 --> 00:02:52.981
-But I heard...
-Can you try to hold it in?
你能忍住先别生吗？

00:02:53.064 --> 00:02:55.066
ELLIE:
Can somebody slap him for me?
谁能替我扇他一巴掌呀？

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.109
(grunts)

00:02:56.192 --> 00:02:57.986
Done and done.
没问题

00:02:58.069 --> 00:02:59.362
Just sit tight.
We're coming!
原地别动 我们来了！

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.905
BUCK:
There's only one thing to do.
就一招了 负鼠 跟我来

00:03:00.989 --> 00:03:02.198
Possums, you're with me.
就一招了 负鼠 跟我来

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.450
Manny, you take care
of Ellie until we get back.
曼尼 你照顾艾莉 等我们回来

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.286
What?! No, you can't leave now.
什么？你现在不能走！

00:03:06.369 --> 00:03:08.788
She's off the trail.
What about rule #2?
她没在路中间！
第二条规定是怎么说的？

00:03:08.872 --> 00:03:12.709
Rule #5 says you can ignore rule #2
if there's a female involved...
第五条规定说你可以不理第二条

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:14.627
or possibly a cute dog.
如果关系到女的或可爱的狗

00:03:14.711 --> 00:03:16.838
You know I just make up
these rules as I go along.
你知道我会随兴订规矩

00:03:16.921 --> 00:03:18.882
Yeah, but, but, but she's...
you have to...
-对 可是她…你得…
-曼尼 没关系

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:21.384
Manny, it's all right.
-对 可是她…你得…
-曼尼 没关系

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.136
I got your back.
我在你背后支持你

00:03:24.762 --> 00:03:26.306
Now you're talking.
这就对了 走吧

00:03:26.389 --> 00:03:29.058
Come on, lads.
这就对了 走吧

00:03:30.018 --> 00:03:32.520
Take care of our sister, mister.
-照顾我们的姐姐 先生
-别紧张

00:03:32.604 --> 00:03:34.480
No pressure.
-照顾我们的姐姐 先生
-别紧张

00:03:34.564 --> 00:03:35.607
BUCK:
What does that mean--
“我在背后支持你”是什么意思？

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.026
"I got your back"?
I mean, I'd rather they covered the front.
罩前面比较好

00:03:38.109 --> 00:03:39.861
That's where all the good stuff is,
isn't it?
好东西都在那里

00:03:39.944 --> 00:03:41.613
DIEGO:
We got to move.
我们得走了

00:03:45.408 --> 00:03:47.619
Whew, okay, all right.
好 没关系

00:03:47.702 --> 00:03:49.329
It's okay.
好 没关系

00:03:49.412 --> 00:03:51.831
Daddy's... Daddy's coming.
爸爸就要来了

00:03:51.915 --> 00:03:55.627
I got to say, sweetheart,
you really got timing.
宝贝 你还真会挑时间

00:03:59.797 --> 00:04:03.843
(dinosaurs hissing)

00:04:03.927 --> 00:04:05.803
(panting)

00:04:05.887 --> 00:04:07.847
Oh!

00:04:07.931 --> 00:04:12.018
(panting)

00:04:12.101 --> 00:04:13.394
Whew.

00:04:13.478 --> 00:04:15.271
-(thunderous rumble)
-(screams)

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:17.232
Go away! Go away!
走开！坏人来啦！

00:04:17.315 --> 00:04:19.776
Shoo! Stranger danger!
Stranger danger!
走开！坏人来啦！

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:25.031
(screaming)

00:04:29.744 --> 00:04:30.620
(gasps)

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:32.372
(growls)

00:04:32.455 --> 00:04:33.373
SID:
Don't worry.
别担心 只是熔岩

00:04:33.456 --> 00:04:36.251
It's just lava.
别担心 只是熔岩

00:04:36.334 --> 00:04:39.837
Deadly, boiling lava!
致命滚烫的熔岩！

00:04:40.546 --> 00:04:44.217
(gasping)

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:47.595
(screaming)

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:56.854
Boys, are you ready for adventure?
-准备好去探险了吗？
-是 长官！

00:04:56.938 --> 00:04:57.772
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.
-准备好去探险了吗？
-是 长官！

00:04:57.855 --> 00:04:59.774
-For danger?
-BOTH: Yes, sir.
-迎接挑战？
-是的 长官！

00:04:59.857 --> 00:05:01.234
For death?
视死如归呢？

00:05:01.317 --> 00:05:03.194
Uh, can you repeat the question?
你能再说一遍吗？

00:05:03.278 --> 00:05:04.445
-Jump!
-(Crash and Eddie screaming)
跳！

00:05:04.529 --> 00:05:06.906
-BUCK: Ha-ha!
-No...!
跳！

00:05:11.369 --> 00:05:13.538
-(pterosaur squawking)
-BUCK: Whoo-hoo...!

00:05:15.415 --> 00:05:16.416
That's right.
对 快点！

00:05:16.499 --> 00:05:17.625
Come on.
对 快点！

00:05:17.709 --> 00:05:20.336
-(pterosaur squawks)
-Ha-ha!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.130
Have you ever flown
one of these before?
你们骑过这种东西吗？

00:05:22.213 --> 00:05:24.048
No, first time, actually!
没有！这是第一次

00:05:24.132 --> 00:05:25.300
Yah!
没有！这是第一次

00:05:25.383 --> 00:05:28.052
Yee-ha!

